      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Wonderful idea! Especially now with the new profiles I think it would be a great feature. Currently the discovery within VRChat is very poor in my opinion.\n\n*The display of player's followers could create the \"popularity contest\" mentality BUT I think it should be also added to allow easy discovery of \"most popular creators\".\n\n*Adding the player's \"isFollowing\" status to UDON could also result in some weird interactions on worlds like \"follow and like to enter\" but maybe could be added as well.\n\nTracked since 2023 but I still believe 🙏",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
