  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-08-04T11:02:26.872Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Allow users to follow creators so they see when they have released a new world or avatars. \n\nIt may work best with just worlds for now. \n\nSo for example if I upload a world and someone likes that world and wishes to see more from me they can follow me and when I upload a new map it will show up under a playlist. Similar to favourites etc.. Lets say you allow users to follow up to 3 creators so they get to see their worlds under 3 seperate playlists.\n\nOr you could have 1 playlist which is just called Following and only shows worlds from creators you follow.",
